e-kickoff cutoff cannot be proven. No source schedule time is fabricated onto a row.","review_fingerprint":"77e6b9d04fb4001fdd77a9c27bdad9a3fa80ac813ca5de47466fcd2c96d501ef","review_timestamp_utc":"2026-09-13T11:43:36Z","source_category":"public downloadable historical football results and bookmaker odds CSV","source_id":"football-data-co-uk-historical-csv","source_name":"Football-Data.co.uk historical results and betting odds CSV archives","source_owner_provider":"Football-Data.co.uk (Joseph Buchdahl); odds compiled from Betbrain.com, OddsPortal, and individual bookmakers","source_url_or_api_identifier":"https://www.football-data.co.uk/downloadm.php; https://www.football-data.co.uk/notes.txt; bounded files under https://www.football-data.co.uk/mmz4281/{season}/D1.csv","storage_permission":"Approved only for bounded operator-controlled raw research storage outside Git with immutable hashes; no raw publication or redistribution.","terms_of_use_status":"The download page states that the data is free and provides files for quantitative testing of betting systems. The disclaimer disclaims correctness and betting liability. No standalone data license or explicit general redistribution grant was found on the reviewed public pages.","timestamp_precision":"Match Date and Time are present and interpreted as Europe/London local fixture time. No per-row or per-quote odds capture timestamp exists.","update_cadence":"season archives with recent results updated by the provider; file Last-Modified metadata is retained through retrieval evidence where observed"},"source_review_verdict":"APPROVED_FOR_CONTROLLED_RAW_RESEARCH_ONLY_CALIBRATION_INELIGIBLE","test_blocker_codes":["ROW_LEVEL_CAPTURE_TIMESTAMPS_UNAVAILABLE","FIXED_24H_CUTOFF_CANNOT_BE_PROVEN","ZERO_PUBLICATION_ELIGIBLE_NORMALIZED_QUOTES"],"test_coverage_sufficient_for_calibration_backtest":false,"timestamp_semantics":"No quote capture column. General collection schedule is not assigned to rows; no timestamp was fabricated."